    "sub_name": "金融商品設計與開發",
    "sub_ename": "THE DESIGN AND DEVELOPMENT FINANCIAL PRODUCTS",
    "describe_ch": "本課程目標在運用理論基礎，研發或設計金融商品，課程內容包括\n1.\t了解當前業界金融商品之類型\n2.\t分析當前業界金融商品之特性\n3.\t運用理論基礎，設計或研發新型態之金融商品",
    "describe_eh": "The main goals of this class is design or develop financial products by theories, including：\r\n1.\tUnderstanding the types of financial products in industries.\r\n2.\tAnalyzing the characteristics of financial products in industries.\r\n3.\tTo design or develop new financial products by theories.\r\n",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
